msgstr "PC5 tidak bisa membuat folder runtime .NET: apakah konsol penuh?"

#: title/pc5_game.c:591
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The app's .NET runtime has no %.80s. Copy the PPSA11018 folder to the "
"console again."
msgstr ""
"Runtime .NET aplikasi tidak punya %.80s. Salin lagi folder PPSA11018 ke "
"konsol."

#: title/pc5_game.c:597
msgid "PC5 can't copy the .NET runtime: is the console full?"
msgstr "PC5 tidak bisa menyalin runtime .NET: apakah konsol penuh?"

#: title/pc5_game.c:605
msgid "PC5 can't finish the .NET runtime's copy."
msgstr "PC5 tidak bisa menyelesaikan penyalinan runtime .NET."

#: title/pc5_home.c:157
