"kali dijalankan."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7642
msgid ""
"The game is copied once and checked, to the console or, with a USB drive "
"plugged in, to its PC5 folder. Whether a game runs is only known by trying "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Game disalin sekali lalu diperiksa, ke konsol atau, jika drive USB "
"terpasang, ke folder PC5-nya. Apakah game bisa jalan hanya bisa diketahui "
"dengan mencobanya."

