msgstr ""
"Menyalin video ke konsol. Biarkan drive sumber terhubung sampai selesai."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8729
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d game is waiting in PC5's INSTALL folders (its own, and PC5/INSTALL on "
"the USB drive). Install it now? A game installed from there is moved into "
"PC5's library, out of the INSTALL folder."
msgstr ""
"%d game menunggu di folder INSTALL PC5 (milik PC5 sendiri, dan PC5/INSTALL "
"di drive USB). Instal sekarang? Game yang diinstal dari sana dipindahkan "
"ke pustaka PC5, keluar dari folder INSTALL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8729
#, c-format
