"%d games are waiting in PC5's INSTALL folders (its own, and PC5/INSTALL on "
"the USB drive). Install them now? A game installed from there is moved "
"into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL folder."
msgstr ""
"%d game menunggu di folder INSTALL PC5 (milik PC5 sendiri, dan PC5/INSTALL "
"di drive USB). Instal sekarang? Game yang diinstal dari sana dipindahkan "
"ke pustaka PC5, keluar dari folder INSTALL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8729
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d game is waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install it now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"%d game menunggu di folder INSTALL PC5. Instal sekarang? Game yang "
"diinstal dari sana dipindahkan ke pustaka PC5, keluar dari folder INSTALL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8729
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d games are waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install them now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"%d game menunggu di folder INSTALL PC5. Instal sekarang? Game yang "
"diinstal dari sana dipindahkan ke pustaka PC5, keluar dari folder INSTALL."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:8741
msgid "Games in PC5's INSTALL folder"
msgstr "Game di folder INSTALL PC5"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8746
msgid "Updating the home screen tile"
msgstr "Memperbarui pintasan layar beranda"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8746
msgid "Its picture and background"
msgstr "Gambar dan latar belakangnya"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8748
msgid "A newer one may have fixed it"
msgstr "Versi yang lebih baru mungkin sudah memperbaikinya"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8751
#, c-format
msgid "Update to PC5 %s first?"
msgstr "Perbarui ke PC5 %s dulu?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8753
#, c-format
msgid "You have %s"
msgstr "Anda punya %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8754
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This may already be fixed in it. Update, try the game again, and report it "
"if it still happens. %s."
msgstr ""
"Masalah ini mungkin sudah diperbaiki di versi itu. Perbarui, coba lagi "
"game-nya, dan laporkan jika masih terjadi. %s."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:8757
msgid "Report anyway"
msgstr "Tetap laporkan"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8762
#, c-format
msgid "Starting %s"
msgstr "Memulai %s"

